{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken Signal is a dark horror shooter where every step through the catacombs could be your last. The laboratory, once a place of science, has turned into a nightmare filled with red-eyed creatures \u2014 failed experiments that escaped control. Your only goal: survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through scattered notes, locked doors, and environmental details. From the reliable double-barreled shotgun to quick pistols and grenades, over eight weapons will be at your disposal to carve a path through the darkness. The tension never leaves you \u2014 every corner hides a new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8+ weapons: from shotguns to grenades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark catacombs and laboratory zones with unique design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Key and note system to uncover the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survival-driven atmosphere with horror elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Red-eyed monsters \u2014 failed experiments gone rogue</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000210?t=1757378698","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000210?t=1757378698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000210/6d1ea1ee6e82d84c33c3f4cf83278c0d2b633e20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757378698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000210/6d1ea1ee6e82d84c33c3f4cf83278c0d2b633e20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757378698","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken Signal is a dark horror shooter where every step through the catacombs could be your last. The laboratory, once a place of science, has turned into a nightmare filled with red-eyed creatures \u2014 failed experiments that escaped control. Your only goal: survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through scattered notes, locked doors, and environmental details. From the reliable double-barreled shotgun to quick pistols and grenades, over eight weapons will be at your disposal to carve a path through the darkness. The tension never leaves you \u2014 every corner hides a new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8+ weapons: from shotguns to grenades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark catacombs and laboratory zones with unique design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Key and note system to uncover the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survival-driven atmosphere with horror elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Red-eyed monsters \u2014 failed experiments gone rogue</p>","developers":["g4m3d3s1gn studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000210/32ea2fbfd203d92022ff353e7a8c5eb8580ffba1/header.jpg?t=1757378698","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192183,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192183/movie480.mp4?t=1757378695","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192183/movie_max.mp4?t=1757378695"},"name":"Base","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192183/91ab3f6bf7ee9c860fdf067e31e60c004861cc43/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757378695","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192183/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757378695","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192183/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757378695"}}],"name":"Broken Signal","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u